ebm?t=1787797428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943650/extras/d2706fe94cee9c0f8774bbdd7973dc7b.mp4?t=1787797428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "FragPunk is a thrilling 5v5 hero shooter where Shard Cards allow you to break the rules of combat and ensure that no two rounds are ever the same. Get ready to unleash your skills!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Japanese, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“It (Fragpunk) really stands out in the hero shooter space.”<br>IGN<br><br>“Hero shooters need a little weird injected into them, and FragPunk is here to do that.”<br>Polygon<br><br>“Fragpunk is like every shooter, everywhere, all at once.”<br>VG247<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943650/6dde17d97da9804dde09c325ddbbdfdfc9bf463a/header_alt_assets_8.jpg?t=1787797428", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943650/3c6396cd7a6f4671775abf9adac442d99687afc0/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_8.jpg?t=1787797428", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943650/3c6396cd7a6f4671775abf9adac442d99687afc0/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_8.jpg?t=1787797428", "website": "https://www.fragpunk.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-4790 or AMD Ryzen 3 3100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 750 TI / AMD RX 550 / Intel Arc A380<br></li><li><strong>Dire